    {
      "type": "model",
      "message": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Now I have all the information. Let me solve the problem.\n\n**Part (1):** In △ABC, AB=3, BC=2√3, cosB=√3/3.\n\nBy the Law of Cosines: AC² = AB² + BC² − 2·AB·BC·cosB = 9 + 12 − 2·3·2√3·(√3/3) = 21 − 12 = 9, so AC = 3.\n\nThen cosA = (AB² + AC² − BC²)/(2·AB·AC) = (9 + 9 − 12)/(2·3·3) = 6/18 = 1/3.\n\n**Part (2):** D on ray BA beyond A, DE∥BC, AE⊥AC, DE=√6. Find CE.\n\nSet coordinates: A at origin, AC along x-axis. Since AC=3, C=(3,0). cosA=1/3, so B = 3(cosA, sinA) = (1, 2√2).\n\nD is on ray BA beyond A, so D = −t·(unit AB direction) = −t(1/3, 2√2/3) for t>0. DE∥BC means E = D + s·(C−B) = D + s(2, −2√2).\n\nAE⊥AC means E has x-coordinate 0 (since AC is x-axis). Let me verify with the constraint DE=√6.",
        "tool_calls": [
          {
            "id": "call_29ff5c429ed14d758c175d0a",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "function",
            "function": {
              "name": "submit_solution",
              "arguments": "{\"region_id\": \"region_art_0020_01\", \"final_answer\": \"（1）cosA = 1/3；（2）CE = 3。\", \"reasoning\": \"【第(1)问】在△ABC中，AB=3，BC=2√3，cosB=√3/3。\\n由余弦定理：AC² = AB² + BC² − 2·AB·BC·cosB = 9 + 12 − 2×3×2√3×(√3/3) = 21 − 12 = 9，故 AC = 3。\\n再由余弦定理求 cosA：\\ncosA = (AB² + AC² − BC²)/(2·AB·AC) = (9 + 9 − 12)/(2×3×3) = 6/18 = 1/3。\\n所以 cosA = 1/3。\\n\\n【第(2)问】建立坐标系：以 A 为原点，AC 所在直线为 x 轴。\\n由 AC=3 得 C(3, 0)。由 cosA=1/3，sinA=√(1−1/9)=2√2/3，且 AB=3，得 B(3cosA, 3sinA) = (1, 2√2)。\\n向量 BC = C − B = (2, −2√2)。\\nD 在 BA 的延长线上（即射线 AB 的反向延长线上），设 D = −t·(1/3, 2√2/3) = (−t/3, −2√2 t/3)，t>0。\\n因 DE∥BC，设 E = D + s·BC = (−t/3 + 2s, −2√2 t/3 − 2√2 s)。\\n因 AE⊥AC，而 AC 沿 x 轴，故 E 的横坐标为 0：−t/3 + 2s = 0，即 s = t/6。\\n于是 E = (0, −2√2 t/3 − 2√2·t/6) = (0, −2√2 t/3 − √2 t/3) = (0, −√2 t)。\\n由 DE = √6：DE = s·|BC| = (t/6)·√(4+8) = (t/6)·2√3 = t√3/3 = √6，得 t = 3√2。\\n所以 E = (0, −√2·3√2) = (0, −6)。\\n于是 CE = √[(3−0)² + (0−(−6))²] = √(9 + 36) = √45 = 3√5。\\n\\n（注：若按 E 在 AC 另一侧取正号，则 E=(0, 6)，CE 同样为 √(9+36)=3√5，结果一致。）\\n\\n因此 CE = 3√5。\"}"
